 "title": "High platelet count: repeat the count, look for the common reactive causes (infection or inflammation, iron deficiency or bleeding, hemolysis) and treat them, and only if it persists consider a clonal cause, essential thrombocythemia or primary myelofibrosis; pancytopenia is sorted into low production, high destruction or sequestration",
